# WordPress is production

This repo transitioned off the Next.js frontend. **Live site = WordPress theme `gabos-2026/` only.**

## Do

- Implement UI, shop/cart, and layout in **`gabos-2026/`** (PHP templates, `style.css`, theme JS if any).
- Deploy with **`npm run deploy:theme`** (FTP upload of changed files under `gabos-2026/` only).
- Use **`docs/mobile-nav-breakpoints.md`** for breakpoint tokens when relevant.

## Do not (default)

- Do **not** change **`src/`**, **`public/`** (for Next), or Next **`app/`** routes unless the user **explicitly** asks to work on the React site again.
- Do **not** assume `npm run dev` / Vercel reflects what users see in production.

## If the user reports a bug on the live site

Fix it in **`gabos-2026/`**, then remind them to run `npm run deploy:theme` (or `--all` if git-based diff missed files).

See **`docs/wordpress-production.md`**.
